[
 {
  "i": 0,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(800,900)}Grand Line\\NMomoiro Island (Kamabakka Kingdom)"
 },
 {
  "i": 1,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is this place?"
 },
 {
  "i": 2,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And more importantly..."
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is with these guys!?"
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn it..."
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Dear Nami-san, Robin-chan..."
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are you doing well?"
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I can't wait to see you again."
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "When I do, I'm sure we'll become great friends."
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "style": "Title",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1200,2000)}The Underwater Prison"
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "style": "Title",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1200,2000)}Impel Down"
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I wanted you and Luffy to become great marines..."
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Nevermind marines, you two brothers have become notorious outlaws."
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm sure you've heard the rumors about Luffy, too."
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "In Water 7, he picked a fight with the World Government..."
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "and somehow managed to invade the Judicial Island, Enies Lobby."
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, yeah. I also told Luffy about his father."
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He was really surprised to hear he had a father."
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Doesn't matter..."
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whether we know about it or not..."
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "as annoying as it is,"
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "both me and Luffy carry the blood of a world-renowned criminal."
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no way we could have ever been marines."
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Even though I owe my mother a debt of gratitude and took the name \"Portgas\"..."
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I still can't stand the thought that I carry the blood of that worthless father of mine."
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't remember him at all, and I don't owe him anything."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah, I get what you mean, but he was just..."
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "style": "Secondary",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's why..."
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Gramps..."
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'd hate to see you die right now, kid."
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Take my name and roam wild and free over the seas!"
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Become my son!"
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My old man is..."
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whitebeard, and no one else."
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vice Admiral Momonga!"
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've spotted a pirate ship."
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whose ship is it?"
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I know I've seen that mark before..."
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll go look into it right away!"
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If you can't remember it offhand,"
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "then it can't be anyone important."
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just ignore it."
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We must get to our destination quickly."
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yessir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's one! A giant Sea-King!"
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If that thing spots us, it'll swallow the ship whole!"
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please don't look this way..."
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's gone."
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "W-We've gotten this far..."
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but I don't know what good we can do if we continue!"
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What should we do now, Big Sis Alvida?"
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't look at me."
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You were the ones who wanted to come here, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You spent so much money on that Eternal Pose, too."
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, we have to save Captain Buggy, who was taken to Impel Down!"
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Take a look at the sea."
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Calm Belt lies just beyond here."
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's the monsters' nest."
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do you really think we can make it through with this ship?"
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The only other route would be to go there on a Navy ship."
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Gates of Justice won't open for a pirate ship, after all."
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No way! You mean we can't even get there?"
 },
 {
  "i": 62,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "At this rate, Captain Buggy will be put to death!"
 },
 {
  "i": 63,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Along with our new buddy, Ace-{\\i1}kun!{\\i0}"
 },
 {
  "i": 64,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Impel Down is the world's largest prison, which can neither be broken into nor escaped from."
 },
 {
  "i": 65,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You should just give up already."
 },
 {
  "i": 66,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This just means that Buggy the Clown's luck as a pirate has run out."
 },
 {
  "i": 67,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's not true!"
 },
 {
  "i": 68,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Captain Buggy wouldn't bite the dust from something like this!"
 },
 {
  "i": 69,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's right! We've sworn to keep following Captain Buggy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 70,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "until the day when we finally find what we've been looking for:"
 },
 {
  "i": 71,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Captain John's treasure island!"
 },
 {
  "i": 72,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Richie!"
 },
 {
  "i": 73,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do whatever you want, then."
 },
 {
  "i": 74,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll take the Big Top, here."
 },
 {
  "i": 75,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You guys can set off in a rowboat."
 },
 {
  "i": 76,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No way! This is Captain Buggy's ship!"
 },
 {
  "i": 77,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Buggy isn't here, is he?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 78,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah. You're right..."
 },
 {
  "i": 79,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I know if we go there, we'll all die, so I'm not going."
 },
 {
  "i": 80,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It'd be a waste to bring the ship there, too."
 },
 {
  "i": 81,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You guys can just chase after Buggy in a rowboat until you're satisfied."
 },
 {
  "i": 82,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah!"
 },
 {
  "i": 83,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, you'll probably die long before you even {\\i1}see{\\i0} Impel Down."
 },
 {
  "i": 84,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Captain Buggy! Thank you so much for everything!"
 },
 {
  "i": 85,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We will never forget what you have done for us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 86,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll pray that your execution be quick and painless!"
 },
 {
  "i": 87,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Farewell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 88,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's meet again in the next life!"
 },
 {
  "i": 89,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is Momonga."
 },
 {
  "i": 90,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Marine code G-1 00660."
 },
 {
  "i": 91,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I will enter the current shortly."
 },
 {
  "i": 92,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Prepare to open the gates!"
 },
 {
  "i": 93,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(100,0)\\fs30\\pos(1052,665.733)}Enies Lobby"
 },
 {
  "i": 94,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(100,0)\\fs22\\pos(99.2,630)}Navy Headquarters\\N(Marineford)"
 },
 {
  "i": 95,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(100,0)\\fs30\\pos(367.6,481)}Mariejois"
 },
 {
  "i": 96,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(100,0)\\fs26\\pos(546.6,646)}Sabaody Archipelago"
 },
 {
  "i": 97,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(689,0)\\fs28\\pos(778.6,142)}The Great Prison\\NImpel Down"
 },
 {
  "i": 98,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(689,0)\\fs26\\pos(974,414.6)}Current\\Nlocation"
 },
 {
  "i": 99,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(689,0)\\fs28\\pos(1066.6,108.2)}Amazon Lily"
 },
 {
  "i": 100,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The ship carrying Luffy and Hancock..."
 },
 {
  "i": 101,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "is about to enter the current\\Nconnecting the three main facilities..."
 },
 {
  "i": 102,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "of the World Government..."
 },
 {
  "i": 103,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "the Tarai Current, which can only be used by the Navy."
 },
 {
  "i": 104,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(600,500)}Great Underwater Prison"
 },
 {
  "i": 105,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(600,500)\\fs60}Impel Down"
 },
 {
  "i": 106,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please, kill me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 107,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey! Newbie!"
 },
 {
  "i": 108,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why are you just sitting there,"
 },
 {
  "i": 109,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "munching away at your bread without first greeting the boss of this cell?"
 },
 {
  "i": 110,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's a rule around here that newbies are supposed to offer their food to the boss!"
 },
 {
  "i": 111,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Learned your lesson yet?"
 },
 {
  "i": 112,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey! Wait!"
 },
 {
  "i": 113,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We were just having a small fight!"
 },
 {
  "i": 114,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We ain't on death row!"
 },
 {
  "i": 115,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let us out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 116,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Four and a half days have passed..."
 },
 {
  "i": 117,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "since the departure from\\N the Island of Women, Amazon Lily."
 },
 {
  "i": 118,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vice Admiral Momonga!"
 },
 {
  "i": 119,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The headwind slowed us down a little,"
 },
 {
  "i": 120,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but we've finally reached Impel Down!"
 },
 {
  "i": 121,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is bad... We have to hurry."
 },
 {
  "i": 122,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Get Hancock, now!"
 },
 {
  "i": 123,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yessir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 124,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hancock-{\\i1}dono!{\\i0} We have arrived!"
 },
 {
  "i": 125,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I will be there shortly."
 },
 {
  "i": 126,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's this?"
 },
 {
  "i": 127,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There are more warships here than there were in the Buster Call!"
 },
 {
  "i": 128,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Currently, this is the most dangerous place in the world."
 },
 {
  "i": 129,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It is obvious that it would be well-guarded."
 },
 {
  "i": 130,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So, Ace is inside here?"
 },
 {
  "i": 131,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He is probably far below the surface."
 },
 {
  "i": 132,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, hide under my clothes."
 },
 {
  "i": 133,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Welcome, Vice Admiral Momonga!"
 },
 {
  "i": 134,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "L-Look at that!"
 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's the Pirate Empress!"
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "She's more beautiful than anyone else!"
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no limit to her beauty!"
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How high can her Beauty Power rise? Ten thousand watts? A million?"
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is all the fuss about?"
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Such a noisy bunch."
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "May I petrify them?"
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please don't."
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Navy doesn't need any more humiliation."
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Your condition for helping us was that you wanted to see the man at the center of these events,"
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Portgas D. Ace, for yourself, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I told you before,"
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but this place is usually strictly off-limits for pirates, even the Seven Warlords of the Sea."
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Once you enter,"
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "you will be restrained with Seastone shackles."
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You will also have to go through a full body check at the entrance."
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We cannot let you free any of the inmates or anything, after all."
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy. They will do a body check once we enter."
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll figure something out. Just keep going!"
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I do not mind."
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?"
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Buggy the Clown?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's escaped from his cell?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is he a Devil Fruit User?"
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Assistant Warden."
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vice Admiral Momonga and the Warlord Hancock-{\\i1}dono {\\i0}have arrived."
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right. I'll be there in a minute."
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "She's so cu...uh...open the gates!"
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Give her whatever service she wants!"
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Time left until Ace's execution..."
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "33 hours."
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here we go, Luffy."
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do take care!"
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hancock-{\\i1}sama!{\\i0} Have a safe trip!"
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stop your buzzing, little flies!"
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't be cruel! Take care, now!"
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "style": "Secondary",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an8}Help us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "style": "Secondary",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an8}Help!"
 },
 {
  "i": 173,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What an oppressive atmosphere."
 },
 {
  "i": 174,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is this what hell is like?"
 },
 {
  "i": 175,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We have finally made it inside."
 },
 {
  "i": 176,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We cannot relax yet, however."
 },
 {
  "i": 177,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I welcome you to my Impel Down!"
 },
 {
  "i": 178,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ah! My mistake!"
 },
 {
  "i": 179,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Calling it \"my\" Impel Down is too ambitious!"
 },
 {
  "i": 180,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I am still but the assistant warden, Hannyabal!"
 },
 {
  "i": 181,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pleasure to meet you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 182,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm Momonga."
 },
 {
  "i": 183,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've heard what you're here for."
 },
 {
  "i": 184,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And you must be the Empress, Hancock-{\\i1}dono?{\\i0}"
 },
 {
  "i": 185,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My Empress, Hancock-{\\i1}dono?{\\i0}"
 },
 {
  "i": 186,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, forgive me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 187,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm being too ambitious again!"
 },
 {
  "i": 188,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That stinking warden..."
 },
 {
  "i": 189,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh! My mistake."
 },
 {
  "i": 190,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warden Magellan is in his office down in Level 4."
 },
 {
  "i": 191,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You will be taken there right now."
 },
 {
  "i": 192,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Your escorts will be Vice Chief Jailer Domino here, and myself."
 },
 {
  "i": 193,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It seems you are short on time, so please, come this way."
 },
 {
  "i": 194,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vice Admiral, you go over there and undergo your body check."
 },
 {
  "i": 195,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Our prisoners are all sent into this cage where they are stripped of their clothes..."
 },
 {
  "i": 196,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...and lowered into pots of boiling water.\\NWe call this process the \"Lukewarm Bath of Hell\"."
 },
 {
  "i": 197,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We use it to \"disinfect\" and baptize our prisoners, before they are put in their cells."
 },
 {
  "i": 198,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Even among those prisoners, there are some who are tougher than others."
 },
 {
  "i": 199,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A few of our recent inmates, Fire Fist Ace..."
 },
 {
  "i": 200,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "as well as the Warlord Jinbe, and..."
 },
 {
  "i": 201,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "the former Warlord, Crocodile..."
 },
 {
  "i": 202,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...all went through the baptism\\Nwithout even batting an eyelash."
 },
 {
  "i": 203,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here you are."
 },
 {
  "i": 204,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Guests check in inside this private room."
 },
 {
  "i": 205,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't worry."
 },
 {
  "i": 206,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please remove that cloak."
 },
 {
  "i": 207,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's the easiest way to conceal someone,"
 },
 {
  "i": 208,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "so please hand it over to me."
 },
 {
  "i": 209,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I have no reason to suspect you,"
 },
 {
  "i": 210,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but if you were thinking of pulling anything suspicious,"
 },
 {
  "i": 211,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "we have monitoring Transponder Snails all over Impel Down."
 },
 {
  "i": 212,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They transmit everything they see to the security monitors."
 },
 {
  "i": 213,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well then, first things first."
 },
 {
  "i": 214,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Put on these Seastone shackles."
 },
 {
  "i": 215,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I am not even a prisoner, yet I still need shackles..."
 },
 {
  "i": 216,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You are too cautious."
 },
 {
  "i": 217,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please, be gentle with me."
 },
 {
  "i": 218,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?"
 },
 {
  "i": 219,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can come out now, Luffy."
 },
 {
  "i": 220,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That was close!"
 },
 {
  "i": 221,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I thought I'd have to make a break for it when they weren't watching..."
 },
 {
  "i": 222,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can turn anything into stone, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 223,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This seems to be as far as I can take you."
 },
 {
  "i": 224,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "After this, my abilities will be restrained by Seastone."
 },
 {
  "i": 225,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And you won't be able to hide once they've taken my cloak."
 },
 {
  "i": 226,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I had hoped to be of more help to you..."
 },
 {
  "i": 227,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What're you saying?"
 },
 {
  "i": 228,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no way I'd have made it all the way here by myself!"
 },
 {
  "i": 229,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You got me inside a building surrounded by warships."
 },
 {
  "i": 230,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You've helped me plenty!"
 },
 {
  "i": 231,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 232,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is a stronghold made to lock people away."
 },
 {
  "i": 233,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No matter what happens, please do not cause an uproar here."
 },
 {
  "i": 234,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If you get captured, you will never be able to get out."
 },
 {
  "i": 235,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Though you are strong, will you promise me to not cause any disturbances?"
 },
 {
  "i": 236,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right, I got it! I promise!"
 },
 {
  "i": 237,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thanks a lot, Hancock!"
 },
 {
  "i": 238,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll never forget what you did for me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 239,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll definitely repay you someday!"
 },
 {
  "i": 240,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just now... you..."
 },
 {
  "i": 241,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "called me..."
 },
 {
  "i": 242,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hancock?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 243,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sure thing, Hammock!"
 },
 {
  "i": 244,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hammock, I want more food!"
 },
 {
  "i": 245,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's up, Hammock?"
 },
 {
  "i": 246,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hancock!"
 },
 {
  "i": 247,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now my life is complete!"
 },
 {
  "i": 248,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, you can turn them back now."
 },
 {
  "i": 249,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll be fine!"
 },
 {
  "i": 250,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This must be... a mutual affection!"
 },
 {
  "i": 251,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They sure are taking their time..."
 },
 {
  "i": 252,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's a security check, so we have to be thorough about it."
 },
 {
  "i": 253,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Even {\\i1}those{\\i0} parts...?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 254,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What are you imagining?"
 },
 {
  "i": 255,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Assistant Warden Hannyabal!"
 },
 {
  "i": 256,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The surveillance Transponder Snail isn't transmitting anything..."
 },
 {
  "i": 257,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is everything all right in there?"
 },
 {
  "i": 258,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Domino! Is something wrong?"
 },
 {
  "i": 259,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The body-check is complete."
 },
 {
  "i": 260,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The surveillance is working again. No problems."
 },
 {
  "i": 261,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I am so sorry."
 },
 {
  "i": 262,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Did that take too long?"
 },
 {
  "i": 263,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Not at all!"
 },
 {
  "i": 264,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No problems here either."
 },
 {
  "i": 265,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What tasteless treatment of someone who isn't a prisoner..."
 },
 {
  "i": 266,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just who do you think I am?"
 },
 {
  "i": 267,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please tolerate it."
 },
 {
  "i": 268,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's one of the rules of Impel Down."
 },
 {
  "i": 269,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is strange..."
 },
 {
  "i": 270,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My memory feels hazy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 271,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please lead the way."
 },
 {
  "i": 272,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "As you wish. Head toward the mega-lift over there."
 },
 {
  "i": 273,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Using this lift, we'll go down to the fourth undersea floor."
 },
 {
  "i": 274,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That will take us to the Inferno, where Prison Warden Magellan's office is."
 },
 {
  "i": 275,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I should warn you, it's pretty hot down there."
 },
 {
  "i": 276,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 277,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I will pray for your fortune."
 },
 {
  "i": 278,
  "style": "Note",
  "name": "",
  "text": "(Thank you!)"
 },
 {
  "i": 279,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He said \"I love you\"!"
 },
 {
  "i": 280,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey!"
 },
 {
  "i": 281,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "H-Hancock-{\\i1}dono!{\\i0} What's wrong?"
 },
 {
  "i": 282,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Be careful with her."
 },
 {
  "i": 283,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's this all of a sudden?"
 },
 {
  "i": 284,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, now where do I go?"
 },
 {
  "i": 285,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That lift is going down,"
 },
 {
  "i": 286,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "and Hancock said Ace was probably at the bottom of the sea..."
 },
 {
  "i": 287,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 288,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is what I've got the Vivre Card for."
 },
 {
  "i": 289,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Blugori jailers are coming back."
 },
 {
  "i": 290,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They've secured food."
 },
 {
  "i": 291,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Open the hatches."
 },
 {
  "i": 292,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Good job."
 },
 {
  "i": 293,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Carry the meat to the freezers."
 },
 {
  "i": 294,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've found him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 295,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The escaped pirate from Shared Cell 4\\Nin Level 1, Buggy the Clown!"
 },
 {
  "i": 296,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've confirmed that he's standing in the hall by Isolation Cell 22!"
 },
 {
  "i": 297,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Capture him immediately!"
 },
 {
  "i": 298,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn, they found me, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 299,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You bastards!"
 },
 {
  "i": 300,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've lost contact with\\N surveillance Transponder Snail #71!"
 },
 {
  "i": 301,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Did you hear that? It's Buggy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 302,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Serves him right for trying to escape on his own!"
 },
 {
  "i": 303,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's got a horrible punishment waiting for him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 304,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There they are! The Blugori!"
 },
 {
  "i": 305,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Go!"
 },
 {
  "i": 306,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Go get him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 307,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Vivre Card is telling me to go down here, but..."
 },
 {
  "i": 308,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's a dead end, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 309,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Prisoner number 8200."
 },
 {
  "i": 310,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What? We're not letting him get away!"
 },
 {
  "i": 311,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They've verified him as a Devil Fruit user!"
 },
 {
  "i": 312,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't forget the Seastone!"
 },
 {
  "i": 313,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 314,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll split up and surround him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 315,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right! I'm in!"
 },
 {
  "i": 316,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 317,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's that?"
 },
 {
  "i": 318,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(480,680)\\fs50}Level 1 - Crimson Floor"
 },
 {
  "i": 319,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are all these rooms prison cells?"
 },
 {
  "i": 320,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Screams?"
 },
 {
  "i": 321,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, whatever. Anyway, I've gotta keep going!"
 },
 {
  "i": 322,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, hey, hey, hey!"
 },
 {
  "i": 323,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 324,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Bro! Bro!"
 },
 {
  "i": 325,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?"
 },
 {
  "i": 326,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait a sec!"
 },
 {
  "i": 327,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What're you doing outside the cage?"
 },
 {
  "i": 328,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh? What's up?"
 },
 {
  "i": 329,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Outside the cage? I came from the outside..."
 },
 {
  "i": 330,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "See ya!"
 },
 {
  "i": 331,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait! Don't lie, dammit!"
 },
 {
  "i": 332,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I ain't lying!"
 },
 {
  "i": 333,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Who are you?"
 },
 {
  "i": 334,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're not a jailer or a torturer, are you?"
 },
 {
  "i": 335,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How come you're outside the cage?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 336,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You sure are noisy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 337,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, right! Do you guys know where Ace is?"
 },
 {
  "i": 338,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace?"
 },
 {
  "i": 339,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace... you mean..."
 },
 {
  "i": 340,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fire Fist Ace?"
 },
 {
  "i": 341,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's right. I wanna save Ace!"
 },
 {
  "i": 342,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't be so reckless!"
 },
 {
  "i": 343,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "True, I did hear that he'd been sent here..."
 },
 {
  "i": 344,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If he is, then he's probably down in Level 5!"
 },
 {
  "i": 345,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No way you'd be able to get near that place."
 },
 {
  "i": 346,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's impossible!"
 },
 {
  "i": 347,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's where they keep the guys with bounties over a 100 million, ya know!"
 },
 {
  "i": 348,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Level 5?"
 },
 {
  "i": 349,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Anyway, Bro."
 },
 {
  "i": 350,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Mind going to the jailers' room and stealing the keys?"
 },
 {
  "i": 351,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah! Please, Bro!"
 },
 {
  "i": 352,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't you think that it must have been fate that we met here, in this huge world?"
 },
 {
  "i": 353,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's that?"
 },
 {
  "i": 354,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Blugori!"
 },
 {
  "i": 355,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Blugori?"
 },
 {
  "i": 356,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Run away, Bro!"
 },
 {
  "i": 357,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They'll kill ya!"
 },
 {
  "i": 358,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's with these guys?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 359,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "To the right!"
 },
 {
  "i": 360,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "To the left!"
 },
 {
  "i": 361,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fools!"
 },
 {
  "i": 362,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't look down on the man with the power of the Split-Split Fruit!"
 },
 {
  "i": 363,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw Hat?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 364,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why are you here?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 365,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh. Buggy, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 366,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why you... don't screw with me, you lowlife!"
 },
 {
  "i": 367,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're as cheeky as ever, I see!"
 },
 {
  "i": 368,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I didn't know you were captured, too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 369,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I came here on my own!"
 },
 {
  "i": 370,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I wasn't captured!"
 },
 {
  "i": 371,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What sort of idiot would willingly enter a prison?"
 },
 {
  "i": 372,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait, could it be that you heard of my imprisonment..."
 },
 {
  "i": 373,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "and came to rescue me?"
 },
 {
  "i": 374,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Like hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 375,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "–Dumbass! I'm getting sick just thinking about it."
 },
 {
  "i": 376,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "–What the hell are you talking about?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 377,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I promised Hancock that I wouldn't cause an uproar here,"
 },
 {
  "i": 378,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but you got me dragged into this!"
 },
 {
  "i": 379,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's not like I {\\i1}wanted{\\i0} you to get involved!"
 },
 {
  "i": 380,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, I just got foiled in\\N\"Buggy's Great Jail-Break Plan\"!"
 },
 {
  "i": 381,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Who gives a damn?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 382,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're coming from the front, too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 383,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 384,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey! Why are you escaping, anyway?"
 },
 {
  "i": 385,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What're you talkin' about, stupid?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 386,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You don't know the kinds of torture they put me through!"
 },
 {
  "i": 387,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "These guys are cold-blooded monsters!"
 },
 {
  "i": 388,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then you just have to avoid getting caught, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 389,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "W-W-What are you talking about?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 390,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm in a hurry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 391,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Come to think of it, I guess I've already caused an uproar."
 },
 {
  "i": 392,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's the thing I can't stand about you and that Red-Hair..."
 },
 {
  "i": 393,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're always thinking positively, but in a bad way."
 },
 {
  "i": 394,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fine. Let's do this!"
 },
 {
  "i": 395,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll just have to do it, won't we?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 396,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Time for a great, flashy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 397,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "change of plans!"
 },
 {
  "i": 398,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Agreed!"
 }
]